          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our Story",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "165160409325b808b3-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hammitt is a design-forward leather brand, established in Los Angeles to shake up the accessory world with a mix of style and functionality. Co-founded by visionaries Stephenie Hammitt and Tony Drockton, this line is for bold, creative expressionists and those that are out for more than just a look—Hammitt’s a lifestyle.<br/><br/>It all started back in 2008 when Stephenie set out to redefine luxury handbags.She wanted something that felt as good as it looked—leather that was buttery soft, hardware that shimmered, and designs that mixed classic with cool. These early years established something special: A pride that ignites in its wearers, a passion for bringing people together, and relentless attention to detail that’s manifested into a movement.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "165160409325b808b3-0",
        "165160409325b808b3-1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "id_for_scroll_navigator": "",
