    "1651604146def64075": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "1651604146c8176d6f-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This elite customer experience has remained our North Star. Hammitt bags have become the ultimate accessory for anyone looking to turn heads with the glimmer of a rivet - and the courage to stand out. We continue to build individual connections with every customer, with 24/7 concierge care that’s based right by the beach in LA. </p><p>But here's the twist: it’s not just about looking good. Hammitt’s commitment to quality? Through annual and ongoing donations, Hammitt contributes to worthy causes, ensuring that every purchase also contributes to making the world a better place. A Hammitt bag isn’t just an accessory—it’s a symbol. A symbol that you don’t follow trends: You set them. So, next time you’re on the town, keep an eye out for those iconic rivets. Because one thing’s for sure: when you’re carrying a Hammitt, the world notices. And who wouldn’t want to be noticed?</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
